        "text_mg6Xtk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>For years, we have dreamed of creating a beautiful Bible in Spanish. The first Bible hand-painted by our founder, Katie, was a bilingual English-Spanish translation. Now, eleven years later, our small business has grown, and we are excited to launch Hosanna Revival Spanish Bibles in three beloved designs.</p><p>Our prayer is that we can reach even more people and invite them into God’s Word through a beautiful cover. </p>",
