        "text_YKw6i9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>“The <strong>Holy Bible, Nueva Traducción Viviente (NTV)</strong> is an outstanding Bible translation written in clear, natural Spanish while remaining faithful to the original biblical languages. It is the result of the work of a team of more than fifty distinguished Bible scholars.</p><p>The NTV's combination of scholarly accuracy and clarity brings even the most difficult biblical passages to life. More importantly, however, countless testimonies show how this Bible is changing people's lives by speaking directly to their hearts. That is why we call it <strong>\"The Truth Made Clear.\"</strong></p><p>The Nueva Traducción Viviente is ideal for people of every age and stage of life because it allows the entire family to read from the same biblical text. The NTV is available in a wide variety of print editions and mobile applications.</p><p>To learn more about the NTV, visit <strong>BibliaNTV.com</strong>. (<a href=\"https://www.tyndale.com/ntv?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">Tyndale</a>)</p>",
